{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:59:16+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:59:16+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Gestamp Automoción, S.A.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"Spain","city":"Madrid","website":"https://www.gestamp.com","employees":39803,"summary":"Gestamp Automoción, S.A. designs, develops, and manufactures metal components for the automotive industry in Western Europe, Eastern Europe, Mercosur, North America, and Asia. The company offers body-in-white products, large components and assembly parts, such as bonnets, roofs, doors, and mudguards, as well as other surface and assembly parts for use in creation of visible exterior skin of vehicles; and structural and crash-related elements, including floors, pillars, rails, and wheel arches. It also provides chassis parts comprising under body of vehicles and includes systems, frames and related parts, such as front and rear axles and couplings, control arms, and integrated couplings; hinges, door checks, electrical systems, and powered systems. In addition, the company offers hydraulic presses and dies in the areas of hot stamping, cold stamping, hydroforming, and try out of tools. Further, it serves vehicle manufacturers. Gestamp Automoción, S.A. was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Madrid, Spain. Gestamp Automoción, S.A. is a subsidiary of Gestamp 2020, S.L.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Gestamp Automocin, S.A. conçoit, développe et fabrique des composants métalliques pour l'industrie automobile en Europe de l'Ouest, en Europe de l'Est, au Mercosur, en Amérique du Nord et en Asie. La société propose des produits de carrosserie en blanc, des composants de grande taille et des pièces d'assemblage, tels que des capots, des toits, des portes et des garde-boue, ainsi que d'autres pièces de surface et d'assemblage destinées à la création de la peau extérieure visible des véhicules; et des éléments structurels et liés à la collision, notamment les planchers, les piliers, les rails et les passages de roue. Il fournit également des pièces de châssis comprenant sous la carrosserie des véhicules et comprend des systèmes, des cadres et des pièces connexes, tels que des essieux avant et arrière et des accouplements, des bras de commande et des accouplements intégrés; charnières, contrôles de porte, systèmes électriques et systèmes motorisés."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1638231424,"shares_outstanding":568830360,"trailing_pe":7.5789475,"forward_pe":6.2168117,"price_to_book":0.6853879,"ev_to_ebitda":4.408,"ev_to_revenue":0.404,"dividend_yield":0.0274,"payout_ratio":0.2439,"beta_yahoo":0.909},"targets":{"current_price":2.88,"mean":3.44727,"median":3.25,"high":4.47,"low":2.5,"n_analysts":11,"reco_mean":2.54545,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-07-30"],"eps_avg":0.06,"eps_low":0.06,"eps_high":0.06,"revenue_avg":2660500000,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-30","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.75518,"institutions_pct":0.124280006,"institutions_float_pct":0.50763,"institutions_n":83,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"American Century ETF Trust-Avantis International Small Cap Value ETF","pct":0.0070999996,"shares":4095139,"value":11794000,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0128},{"name":"Old Westbury Funds Inc-Old Westbury Small & Mid Cap Strategies Fund","pct":0.0031,"shares":1768047,"value":5091975,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0025,"shares":1417619,"value":4082742,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0053},{"name":"WisdomTree Trust-WisdomTree Europe Hedged Equity Fund","pct":0.0022,"shares":1289618,"value":3714099,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.0172},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-DFA Intl Small Cap Value PORT.","pct":0.0021,"shares":1183166,"value":3407518,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"D